description:
Backlog, after the 2026-11-10 demo. Source: antigravity's DX benchmark (comms 2026-11-04 18:15).

Candidates, to be scoped after the demo:

* steerable plan (pause / edit steps mid-run);
* right-hand inspector with a full diff and a live sandbox terminal (stream `execute` output and SIS console);
* budget burn meter against the run's limits;
* explicit interrupt control;
* run records as an audit-log table;
* structured approval arguments with a confirmation for reject.

This builds on the ChatItem render model from the demo story. Not before the TC1/TC2/TC3 rehearsals are done.
